5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I think we should be careful about the building's limits. I'd like to look into the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree that caution is necessary. For my part, I want to see the weekend head counts across ten seasons and the five years of visitor comment slips to understand what actually draws people back.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know who is actually helping us! I'll check the composition of the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing and backlog. We can't just guess who's available to work!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to make sure everything actually arrives on time! I'll look into the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the loan transport costs over three seasons. Let's see where we've had trouble before!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we are all quite thorough today. To ensure our budget doesn't vanish into the ether, I shall examine the mount-making charges and joiner's rate, as well as the maintenance log for powered displays.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think those are good choices. Everyone seems to be looking at different things, so we should get a full picture. I'm just worried about the space being pushed too far.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"It is a comprehensive approach. By analyzing the visitor data alongside the structural and financial constraints you all mentioned, we can avoid the mistake of choosing a show that looks good on paper but fails in practice.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,Exactly! We need to know if we have enough people to actually run the show. It's no use having a great idea if there's nobody to do the work!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I totally agree with Rin! It's all about making it work in real life. I'm excited to see if the paperwork is what's slowing us down. We've got this covered!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the synergy of our inquiries is quite promising. While some of us focus on the physical and human infrastructure, I shall keep a watchful eye on the hidden costs that tend to surprise us.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't have anything else to add. I'm just hoping the survey doesn't show anything too worrying. I'll wait for the results.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I believe we have covered the necessary ground. I will wait for the data to arrive so we can evaluate the proposals with a clear understanding of our limitations and our audience's preferences.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm ready too! I can't wait to see if the lab is as empty as I think it is. Let's get the answers and pick the best exhibition!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"Me too! I'm all set. I hope the shipping stuff isn't as messy as I think, but it's better to know now than later. Let's do this!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A most efficient start. Since we have reached a consensus on our respective areas of investigation, I believe we can conclude this round. I shall await the findings with a mixture of curiosity and caution.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
